# PHASE 4 — Bug Bash, Dead Links, and Real Auth Gating

**Read `00 - START HERE` first for ground rules.** This phase touches only pages/components that already exist. It creates exactly one new file (`app/not-found.tsx`) plus one new shared component (`ConfirmDialog`) and one new shared store slice (profile fields) — everything else is edits to existing files. No new routes. Do not build the Library, Presets, Compare, Marketplace detail, Creator dashboard, Billing subpages, Account subpages, Help, Search, Onboarding, or Blog pages in this phase — those are Phase 5, and several fixes below deliberately point at those not-yet-built paths so Phase 5 has nothing left to wire up.

Work through the sections in order. Each fix names the exact file, the exact current behavior, and the exact required behavior.

