`app/docs/page.tsx` renders every `DOC_SECTIONS` entry inside a plain `<div>` — there is no `<Link>` anywhere in the card, so nothing happens on click even once `/docs/[slug]` exists. Wrap each card in `<Link href={`/docs/${doc.slug}`}>` now. The destination route itself (`app/docs/[slug]/page.tsx`, rendering `DocSection.blocks`) is built in Phase 5 — this just makes the card an actual clickable link pointed at the right place.

