`app/app/live/page.tsx` imports `Volume2`, `VolumeX`, and `RefreshCw` from `lucide-react` and never renders any of them — evidence of a sound-alert toggle and a manual reconnect button that were planned and never wired up. Implement both, next to the existing "Pause Feed" / "Resume Feed" control:

