- **Reconnect button**: `RefreshCw`, calls a `handleReconnect` that resets `latency` to a fresh random value, pushes one `system`-type log line ("Reconnected to NSE Level 2 feed gateway"), and if `isStreaming` was somehow false, sets it back to true. Fires a `toast.success('Reconnected', ...)`.

